{"id": "105796", "revid": "25926", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105796", "title": "International Standard Serial Number", "text": "\"International Standard Serial Number\" - ISSN (Nomor S\u00e9ri Standar Internasional) nya\u00e9ta hiji nomer husus anu dipak\u00e9 salaku ciri \"publikasi\" dina waktu anu tangtu tina hiji \"media cetak\" anapon \u00e9l\u00e9ktronik. Nomer ieu kawas no anu dijieun pikeun buku anu tayalian ISBN.\nAnu ngatur kaluarna ISSN di Indon\u00e9sia.\n\"Pusat Dokumentasi dan Informasi Ilmiah\" (PDII) LIPI tayalian lembaga pamar\u00e9ntahan anu bisa ngaluarkeun no ISSN \"National Center\" pikeun pamak\u00e9an nagara Indon\u00e9sia, sarta mibanda tugas jeung \"wewenang\" pikeun ngalaksanakeun \"tugas\" ngaroris sakab\u00e9h publikasi p\u00e9riodik nu dipedalkeun di Indon\u00e9sia. Salaku bag\u00e9an tina \u00e9ta tanggung-jawab, PDII ngaluarkeun ISSN anu mangrupa tanda pangwanoh anu husus unggal aya m\u00e9dia anu medalan sarta lumaku sacara global.\nISSN dikaluarkeun ku [ISDS] \"(International Serial Data System)\" anu dumuk di Paris, Prancis. ISSN \"diadopsi\" salaku \"implementasi\" ISO-3297 dina taun 1975 ku \"Subkomite\" no. 9 ti Komite T\u00e9knik no. 46 tina ISO (TC 46/SC 9). ISDS ngadelegasikeun m\u00e9r\u00e9 nomer ieu ISSN boh sacara r\u00e9gional anapon Nasional. Pikeun r\u00e9gional Asia puseurna di \"Thai National Library\", Bangkok, Thailand. PDII LIPI mangrupakeun hiji-hijina ISSN \"National Centre\" pikeun Indon\u00e9sia.\nTisaprak 1 April 2008, sakab\u00e9h pros\u00e9s timimiti daptar nepika medalna ISSN di Indon\u00e9sia geus dilakukeun sacara \u00e9lektronik ngaliwatan situs ISSN Online anu dikokolakeun PDII LIPI. Ku ayana ieu sistim leuwih ngagampangkeun ngokolaan ISSN, murah jeung siparna nembrak. Leuwih ti \u00e9ta sistem ieu m\u00e9r\u00e9 \"fasilitas\" tambahan mangrupa \"barcode generator online\" anu bisa dipak\u00e9 pikeun nyieun kodebar ISSN henteu kudu mibanda pakakas atawa \"softwarena\" anu hargana lumayan mahal. \"Fasilitas\" ieu mangrupakeun anu munggaran di dunya tur \"diintegrasikeun\" kana ngokolaan ISSN.\nNomor ISSN jeung kodebar.\nSarua jeung ISBN, \"kodebar\" pikeun ISSN ngagunakeun \"EAN-13\" anu diwangun ku 13 \"digit\". Tapi nomer ISSN diwangun ku \"kombinasi\" 8 angka jeung hurup X. Tapi nomer husus salaku \"identifikasi\" ISSN ngan 7 angka pangheulana, sedengkeun angka / hurup X anu pandeuri tayalian \"karakter c\u00e9k ISSN.\"\nSedengkeun kodebar ISSN memakai standar EAN-13 anu diwangun ku kombinasi 13 angka jeung hurup X, cirina 3 angka panghareupna 977 dituturkeun ku 7 angka pang hareupna nomer ISSN, 2 angka tambahanna pikeun kode medalna media tur 1 \"karakter\" \"c\u00e9k\" EAN-13.\nPikeun leuwih jero ngeunaan ISSN sarta kodebarna bisa dibaca di halaman manual ISSN Online."}
{"id": "105797", "revid": "25926", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105797", "title": "Yazid bin Abdul Qadir Jawas", "text": "Yazid bin Abdul Qadir Jawas, Lc. (1963 \u2013 11 Juli 2024) nya\u00e9ta saurang sastrawan, dos\u00e9n, ustaz, jeung pendakwah Sunni Indon\u00e9sia. Di Indon\u00e9sia, ceramah Yazid sering dipatalikeun sareng gerakan Salafiyah ultra-konservatif. Anjeunna og\u00e9 katelah seueur nyerat buku agama Islam dina basa Indon\u00e9sia.\nKahirupan mimiti.\nDina mimiti atikanna, Yazid kacatet minangka lulusan LIPIA sarta murid ti Abdur Razaq bin Abdul Muhsin al-Abbad, profesor ti Universitas Islam Madinah. Yazid og\u00e9 dipikanyaho diajar sareng Muhammad bin Shalih al-Utsaimin, saurang ulama Sunni ti Mekah. Kacaritakeun og\u00e9 Yazid ngawasa kitab \"Bulughul Maram\" karangan Ibnu Hajar, anu harita diklaim ngan saeutik jalma anu bisa ngawasa ieu kitab. \nKagiatan.\nYazid ayeuna nuju ngawangun pasantr\u00e9n di wewengkon Dramaga, Bogor, nya\u00e9ta pasantr\u00e9n Minhajus Sunnah. Salian ti riweuh dina kagiatan ngajar santri di pasantr\u00e9n, man\u00e9hna og\u00e9 aktif jadi narasumber di Radio Rodja jeung ngayakeun pengajian rutin jeung tabligh akbar di sagala rupa kota di Indon\u00e9sia. Yazid og\u00e9 loba nulis buku agama Islam dina basa Indon\u00e9sia.\nMaot.\nYazid pupus dinten Kemis 11 Juli 2024 sakitar jam 13.35 WIB, saparantos gering nalika ngalaksanakeun ibadah haji di Mekah, anjeunna teras dimakamkeun di Bogor. Pupusna Yazid ngabalukarkeun kasedih pikeun masarakat Salafi di Indon\u00e9sia; Khalid Basalamah, salah saurang pendakwah Salafi terkemuka di Indon\u00e9sia engk\u00e9 ngucapkeun belasungkawa ka Yazid dina salah sahiji ceramahna.\nKritikus.\nYazid dituduh ku sabag\u00e9an Muslim Indon\u00e9sia salaku pengikut aliran Islam puritan sarta mindeng disebut Wahhabist .Kritikus Yazid condong nyebat anjeunna pengikut aliran Islam anu puritan, kasar sareng ketat pisan. Hal ieu bisa jadi sabab Yazid nolak sikep \"taqlid\" anu nurutkeun man\u00e9hna geus loba karuksakan ka umat Islam Indon\u00e9sia.Sanajan kitu, sagolongan Muslim og\u00e9 muji Yazid sarta disebut anjeunna jalma anu calakan sarta luhur pangaweruh.\nSalah sahiji bukuna, \"Mulia jeung Manhaj Salaf\", nimbulkeun kontroversi di Indon\u00e9sia. Pangadeg Front Pembela Islam jeung dos\u00e9n Islam Indon\u00e9sia, Rizieq Shihab ngritik buku ieu. Rizieq Shihab og\u00e9 nandeskeun y\u00e9n Indon\u00e9sia, Malaysia jeung Brunei, salaku nagara anu mayoritas pendudukna ngagem agama Asy'ari, og\u00e9 kudu mibanda undang-undang anu ngalarang sumebarna faham Wahabi."}
{"id": "105800", "revid": "11449", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105800", "title": "Angiospermae", "text": "Angiospermae atawa disebut og\u00e9 \"Magnoliophyta\" nya\u00e9ta sakumpulan tutuwuhan anu sikinana diwengku/dibulen dina buah anu asalna tina ovarium (ovarium). Angiospermae asalna tina kecap \"angio\" anu hartina kembang jeung \"spermae\" anu hartina tutuwuhan siki. Angiospermae disebut tutuwuhan siki katutup sabab sikinana sok dikurilingan ku awak anu asalna tina daun buah anu disebut \"ovarium\", tuluy ovarium jeung bagian s\u00e9j\u00e9n kembang bakal tumuwuh jadi buah jeung siki\novule.\nCiri-ciri Angiospermae.\nTutuwuhan siki katutup (Angiospermae) nya\u00e9ta tutuwuhan anu sikina katutup dina ovarium buah.\nCiri-ciri tutuwuhan siki katutup nya\u00e9ta dihandap ieu:\nR\u00e9produksi generatif.\nR\u00e9produksi generatif nya\u00e9ta \"formasi individu\" anyar ku \"fusi\" gam\u00e9t jalu jeung \"gam\u00e9t\" bikang. R\u00e9produksi s\u00e9ksual bisa lumangsung dina tutuwuhan siki kabuka (Gymnosperms) jeung tutuwuhan kembangan (Angiosperms). \"Organ\" r\u00e9produktif \"Angiospermae\" nya\u00e9ta kembang. Kembang bisa\ndibagi kana kembang lengkep jeung kembang teu lengkep. Kembang lengkep diwangun ku kelopak (\"calyx\"), makuta (\"corolla\"), benang sari (\"stamen\") sareng putik (\"pistilum\"). \nBenang sari diwangun ku antera (antera) jeung stamen stamen (filam\u00e9n). Putik (pistilum) diwangun ku \"stigma\", putik (gaya), jeung ovarium \nKembang teu lengkep nya\u00e9ta kembang anu teu mibanda hiji atawa leuwih bagian kembang. Contona, kembang nu teu boga \"petals\" atawa makuta kembang."}
{"id": "105801", "revid": "31482", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105801", "title": "\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba4, \u1b8c\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b80, \u1b98\u1b92\u1b80", "text": "\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b91\u1b86\u1b92 \u1b9e\u1b9c\u1b82 \u1b9e\u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b8f\u1ba4 \u1b93\u1ba6\u1b9e \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1b8e\u1b99\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8c\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b80, \u1b8a\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b95\u1b92\u1ba6\u1b94\u1baa \u1b98\u1b92\u1b80, \u1b95\u1ba2\u1ba7\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa\u1b9e\u1ba4 \u1b8f\u1b9d \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b8d\u1b82, \u1b84\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1ba7\u1b94\u1ba6\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b83.\n\u1b9e\u1b8f\u1b9b\u1b82.\n\u1b83\u1b9a\u1b94 \u1b93\u1ba6\u1b9e \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b92\u1ba9 \u1b98\u1ba4\u1b9e \u1b9c\u1ba9\u1b95\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b92\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b96\u1ba7\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba3\u1ba7\u1b81 \u1b83\u1b92\u1b9d \u1b95\u1b8d\u1b93\u1ba8\u1b8c\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba6\u1b9e \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba4, \u1b91 \u1b86\u1b92 \u1b99\u1baa\u1b98\u1b82 \u1b8a\u1b9a\u1b84 \u1b8a\u1b82\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1bae\u1ba7\u1b84\u1b81, \u1b91 \u1b86\u1b92 \u1b9e\u1ba7\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba5 \u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b99\u1b92\u1b9b\u1b99\u1baa. \u1b9d\u1b8a\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba5 \u1ba0\u1b9b\u1ba4\u1b92 \u1b8a\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b92\u1b94\u1b94\u1baa \u1b99\u1b92\u1b9b\u1b99\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b8c\u1ba5\u1b80 \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b92\u1b85\u1b94\u1baa |\u1bb1\u1bb6\u1bb2\u1bb8| \u1b99\u1baa. \u1b9d\u1b8a\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba5 \u1ba0\u1b9b\u1ba4\u1b92 \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b8c\u1ba5\u1b80 \u1b8d\u1ba4\u1b9b\u1ba4\u1b99\u1baa \u1b95\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b8a\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a \u1b98\u1b92\u1b97\u1ba4\u1b83 \u1b94\u1ba5\u1b92\u1ba5\u1b81\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b95\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b8a\u1b94\u1baa \u1b99\u1b92\u1b9b\u1b99\u1baa \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b95\u1b8d\u1ba8\u1b9b\u1b94\u1baa \u1b92\u1ba5\u1b99\u1ba8\u1b80\u1b8c\u1ba5\u1b80 \u1b98\u1ba0\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba8\u1b8a\u1baa\u1b9e\u1ba7 \u1b83\u1b92\u1b9d \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b95\u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1b9c\u1baa \u1ba0\u1b9b\u1ba4\u1b92, \u1b99\u1ba4\u1b94\u1b80\u1b8a \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b92\u1b9b \u1b99\u1b92\u1b9b\u1b99\u1baa \u1b85\u1b92\u1b9b, \u1b9e\u1b80\u1b8c\u1ba9\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b92\u1b9b \u1b98\u1b92\u1b97\u1ba4\u1b83 \u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b99\u1b92\u1b9b\u1b99\u1baa \u1b88\u1b9c\u1ba8\u1b82 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b98 \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b99\u1b87\u1b92\u1baa \u1b9e\u1b81\u1b92 \u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b98 \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b9e\u1b9c\u1b99\u1ba8\u1b92\u1baa, \u1b8a\u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b95\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba1\u1b84 \u1bae\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1bae\u1ba7\u1b84\u1b81 \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b98\u1b9c\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba9\u1b84 \u1b8a \u1b8a\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1b9c\u1baa. \u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b98 \u1b95\u1ba2\u1b8f\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba4\u1b92\u1baa \u1b83\u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b99\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b82 \u1b8a\u1ba8\u1b94\u1ba8\u1b82 \u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b9b\u1ba5\u1b95\u1baa \u1b8a\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b81 \u1b8a \u1b9c\u1ba9\u1b9d\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b9e\u1b81\u1b92 \u1b83\u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b81\u1b94 \u1b8d\u1b93\u1ba8\u1b8c\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba7\u1b94\u1baa/\u1b93\u1ba8\u1b9e \u1b9e\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b99\u1baa\u1b95\u1b92\u1baa \u1b9e\u1b95\u1ba8\u1b81\u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b95\u1b8d\u1ba8\u1b9b\u1b94\u1baa \u1b9e\u1b99\u1baa\u1b98\u1ba7\u1b80, \u1b8a\u1ba1\u1b84 \u1b8a\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1baa \u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b9e\u1ba4, \u1b8a\u1ba1\u1b84 \u1b8c\u1ba8\u1b94\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba7\u1b80 \u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b94\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba7\u1b80, \u1b8a\u1ba1\u1b84 \u1b8a\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa\u1b8e\u1ba4, \u1b8a\u1ba4 \u1b93\u1ba8\u1b99\u1b80 \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1b80 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b87\u1b8c\u1ba8 \u1b99\u1baa\u1b98\u1b82 \u1bae\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1bae\u1ba7\u1b84\u1b81 \u1b83\u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b99\u1ba5\u1b8a \u1b93\u1ba8\u1b9e \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b93\u1b93\u1ba4."}
{"id": "105802", "revid": "31482", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105802", "title": "\u1b8c\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b80, \u1b98\u1b92\u1b80", "text": "\u1b8c\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b80 \u1b91\u1b86\u1b92 \u1b9e\u1b9c\u1b82 \u1b9e\u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b8f\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1b8e\u1b99\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b95\u1b92\u1ba6\u1b94\u1baa \u1b98\u1b92\u1b80, \u1b95\u1ba2\u1ba7\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa\u1b9e\u1ba4 \u1b8f\u1b9d \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b8d\u1b82, \u1b84\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1ba7\u1b94\u1ba6\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b83."}
{"id": "105803", "revid": "25926", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=105803", "title": "Kabupat\u00e9n Ac\u00e9h Timur", "text": "Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur () nya\u00e9ta hiji kabupat\u00e9n anu perenahna di beulah w\u00e9tan propinsi Ac\u00e9h, Indonesia. Dina ahir taun 2023, jumlah pangeusi Aceh Timur lobana 449.796 jiwa.\nKabupaten ieu og\u00e9 kagolongkeun kana kabupat\u00e9n anu beunghar ku minyak sagigireun Aceh Utara jeung Aceh Tamiang. Wewengkon ieu og\u00e9 dipiwanoh salaku markas \"Gerakan Aceh Merdeka\" sam\u00e9m\u00e9h dilumakukeunna Darurat Militer tisaprak M\u00e9i 2003. Sam\u00e9m\u00e9h dilaksanakeun Darurat Militer ieu, kawasan Aceh Timur kagolongkeun kana wewengkon anu geueuman, utamana di wewengkon Peureulak jeung sabudeureunna.\nSajarah.\nMangsa \"Prasejarah\"-Karajaan.\nDaratan Aceh Timur geus dicicingan manusa tisaprak Pertengahan Zaman Batu (Zaman Mesolitikum). Ieu dumasar hasil panaluntikan anu dilakukeun ku DR. H. Kupper anu nyebutkeun y\u00e9n geus kapanggih pakakas anu dijieun tina batu beunang ngagosok sabulah anu dimangpaatkeun ku manusa dina galian di wewengkon anu aya di Kuta Binjai jeung Alue Ie Mirah \u00b1 15 Km ti Kota Idi.\nZaman Batu Ngora \"(Neolitikum)\" di Asia Tenggara ditaksir kurang leuwih 1.000 tahun sam\u00e9m\u00e9h Mas\u00e9hi. Mangsa harita, aya Bangsa Proto Malay \"(Melayu Tua)\" anu nyebar ka kamamana kaasup ka Aceh Timur jeung Aceh Utara. Kabudayaan maran\u00e9hna leuwih maju dibandingkeunn jeung bangsa sam\u00e9m\u00e9na, maran\u00e9hna geus ngasakan kadaharanna sarta ngalaksanakeun tatan\u00e9n.\nSatuluyna dina taun 300 SM, aya Bangsa Deutoro Malay \"(Melayu Baru)\" kalayan mibanda kabudayaan anu leuwih maju. Daratangna maran\u00e9hna di Ac\u00e9h ngajadikeun sawar\u00e9h Bangsa Proto Malay \"(Melayu Tua)\" anu henteu da\u00e9k campur/\"berassimilasi\" ngungsi ka jero leuweung/\"pedalaman\". Numutkeun ahli-ahli sajarah s\u00e9sa-s\u00e9sa Bangsa Proto Malay ieu tayalian karuhun maran\u00e9hna t\u00e9h urang Gayo, Batak, Nias jeung Toraja.\nNalika balawirina kapal balantik unggal nagara anu ngaliwatan laut beuki ram\u00e9 ngaronjat, daratang ka pulo Ac\u00e9h sodagar ti \"Parsia\" (Persia sekarang), Gujarat (India), China jeung \u00c9ropa pikeun balantik sarta n\u00e9angan tangkal kai Peureulak pikeun dijieun kapal. Sabada ageman Islam mekar di basisir Arab diutus oge da\u2019i-da\u2019i ka wewengkon w\u00e9tan pikeun nyebarkeun agama Islam. Maran\u00e9hna aya anu daratang ka Peureulak tur nganjrek didinya.\nDina po\u00e9 salasa 1 Muharram 225 H (840 M), diproklamirkeun ngadegna Kasultanan Peureulak kalayan Sayed Maulana Abdul Aziz Syah (840-864 M) salaku raja munggaran, sarta puseur dayeuh karajaan di Bandar Khalifah. Ibnu Bathuthah og\u00e9 Marco Polo kungsi ngajugjug ka Peureulak sarta nulis anu dicutat y\u00e9n \u00e9ta nagara geus ngalaman kamajjuan anu ngaronjat di sahandapeun pamar\u00e9ntahan saurang Raja anu taat kana agama, sarta masaraktna geus ngagem ageman islam Islam.\nPamekaran.\nTisaprak taun 2000, Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur ngarandapan pam\u00e9karan anu dimaksudkeun pikeun pangwangunan anu leuwih rata. Da\u00e9rah hasil pamekaran \u00e9ta kayaning :\nMindahkeun Puseur Dayeuh.\nSam\u00e9m\u00e9hna puseur dayeuh Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur tayalian Kota Langsa kiwari ku ayana disatujuan UU No. 3 Tahun 2001, puseur dayeuh Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur dipindahkeun ka Idi Rayeuk anu pangeusina kurang leuwih 34.282 jiwa (Sensus Penduduk Tahun 2010).\n\u00c9konomi.\nKabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur lega na kurang leuwih 6.040,60 Km\u00b2, sacara administratif Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur diwangun ku 24 kacamatan, 54 dusun, 513 d\u00e9sa, 1 kalurahan jeung 1.596 dusun. Ngaran-ngaran kacamatan anu aya di Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur tayalian Kacamatan Simpang Ulim, Kacamatan Julok, Kacamatan Nurussalam, Kacamatan Darul Aman, Kacamatan Idi Rayeuk, Kacamatan Peureulak, Kacamatan Rantau Selamat, Kacamatan Birem Bayeun, Kacamatan Serba Jadi, Kacamatan Rantau Peureulak, Kacamatan Pante Bidari, Kacamatan Madat, Kacamatan Indra Makmur, Kacamatan Idi Tunong, Kacamatan Banda Alam, Kacamatan Peudawa, Kacamatan Peurelak Timur, Kacamatan Peureulak Barat, Kacamatan Sungai Raya, Kacamatan Simpang Jernih, Kacamatan Darul Ihsan, Kacamatan Peunaron, Kacamatan Idi Timur, sarta Kacamatan Darul Falah.\nSacara umum Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur mangrupakeun dataran landeuh, pasir-pasir, sawar\u00e9h mangrupakeun rawa-rawa jeung leuweung [[babakoan], kalayan perenahna dina luhurna beungeut cai laut 0\u2013308 m. Kaayaan topografi daerah Kabupaten Aceh Timur digolongkeun kana 4 kelas [[lamping]] tayalian : 0-2%, 2-15%, 5-40% sarta &gt; 40%. Ditempo tina dengdekna anu &gt;40% ngan saukur 6,7% tayalian ngalimpudan Kacamatan Birem Bayeun jeung Serbajadi. Sedangkeun wewengkon anu mibanda [[lamping]] dengdek 0-2%,2-15% sarta 5-40% Ngalimpudan sakab\u00e9h kacamatan.\nKomoditas unggulan Kabupat\u00e9n Aceh Timur tayalian sektor tatanen jeung jasa. S\u00e9ktor tatan\u00e9n komoditas unggulanna tayalian sub s\u00e9ktor tutuwuhan perkebunan sarta komoditas [[Kalapa Sawit]], [[Coklat]], [[Kar\u00e9t]] jeung [[Kalapa]]. Sub s\u00e9ktor tatan\u00e9n komoditas anu diunggulkeun tayalian [[Jagong]] jeung [[sampeu]].\nSalaku panunjel kagiatan \u00e9konomi, di Kabupat\u00e9n ieu aya 1 Palabuhan [[Industri]], nya\u00e9ta Palabuhan Idi. Pikeun industri sadia 6 kawasan industri, tayalian Kawasan Industri UMKM Pisang Sale, Kawasan Industri Klapa Terpadu, Kawasan Industri Pangolahan [[ho\u00e9]], Kawasan Industri \"Agro\" sarta \"Perikanan\", Kawasan Industri Kelapa Terpadu Timur (KITAT) jeung Kawasan Industri Migas Pertambangan jeung \u00c9nergi anu dirojong ku fasilitas [[listrik]] jeung [[telekomunikasi]]. Pariwisatana tayalian wisata alam, wisata adat jeung budaya.\nTutumbu ka luar.\n[[Kategori:Babagian administratif di Indon\u00e9sia]]\n[[Kategori:Kota di Indon\u00e9sia]]\n[[Kategori:Ac\u00e9h]]\n[[Kategori:Kota di Indon\u00e9sia]]\n[[Kategori:Kabupat\u00e9n di Ac\u00e9h]]"}
