{"id": "106102", "revid": "25926", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106102", "title": "Hasri Ainun Besari", "text": "Hasri Ainun Besari atawa Hasri Ainun Habibie (11 Agustus 1937 \u2013 22 Mei 2010) nya\u00e9ta saurang dokter ti Indon\u00e9sia jeung garwa ti tilas Pr\u00e9sid\u00e9n B. J. Habibie. Anjeunna ngajabat minangka Ibu Nagara Indon\u00e9sia ti taun 1998 nepi ka 1999.\nKahirupan mimiti.\nAinun lahir dina tanggal 11 Agustus 1937 di Semarang tina pasangan R. Mohamad Besari, saurang dos\u00e9n, sareng pamajikanana Sadarmi Besari, saurang bidan, anu kaw\u00e9ntar minangka kulawarga anu terpelajar jeung int\u00e9l\u00e9ktual. Anjeuna jeung dulur-dulurna diajar di SMP Kristen Dago. Dulur pangkolotna, Sahari, lulus ti SMP basa Ainun masih k\u00e9n\u00e9h di kelas dua, tuluy nuluykeun pendidikanana di Institut T\u00e9knologi Bandung. Ainun nuluykeun pendidikanana di Fakultas Kedokteran Universitas Indon\u00e9sia jeung lulus dina taun 1961.\nNalika kawin.\nAinun munggaran patepung jeung B. J. \"Rudy\" Habibie nalika maran\u00e9hna masih k\u00e9n\u00e9h sakola di SMP. Aranjeunna t\u00e9h babaturan sakola nalika diajar di SMP Kristen Dago. Kulawarga maran\u00e9hna geus lila kenal jeung remen silih aanjangan. Dina taun 1962, Rudy jeung Ainun patepung deui. Maran\u00e9hna silih bogoh tuluy kawin dina tanggal 12 M\u00e9i 1962. Bulan madu maran\u00e9hna lumangsung di Yogyakarta, Bali, jeung Ujung Pandang. Liburan Rudy salila tilu bulan di Indon\u00e9sia gancang b\u00e9r\u00e9s, sarta maran\u00e9hna pindah ka Aachen, tempat Rudy gaw\u00e9. Saprak karawin, Ainun jeung Rudy miboga dua budak lalaki.\nWafat.\nHasri Ainun ngalaman panyakit kanker ovarium, sarta dina tanggal 24 Maret 2010, Hasri Ainun Habibie dirawat di rumah sakit Ludwig-Maximilians-Universit\u00e4t, Klinikum Grosshadern, M\u00fcnchen, J\u00e9rman, jeung ngalakukeun salapan kali operasi. Opat tina salapan operasi \u00e9ta mangrupakeun operasi utama, sedengkeun sisana mangrupa operasi \u00e9ksplorasi.\nDina tanggal 22 M\u00e9i 2010 kira-kira jam 17.35 CEST di M\u00fcnchen, Jerman, Ainun wafat saenggeus ngaliwatan masa kritis salila hiji po\u00e9, anu hirupna disokong ku alat. Layon Hasri Ainun Habibie dikirim tanggal 24 M\u00e9i 2010 ti J\u00e9rman jeung nepi di Jakarta dina tanggal 25 M\u00e9i 2010, lajeng dimakamkeun di Taman Makam Pahlawan Nasional Utama Kalibata dina po\u00e9 anu sarua.\nPikeun ngahormat Habibie sareng Ainun, Pamar\u00e9ntah Kota Par\u00e9par\u00e9 ngadegkeun Monum\u00e9n Cinta Sajati Habibie-Ainun di tengah kota. Monum\u00e9n ieu diresmikeun ku B. J. Habibie dina kunjunganana ka Par\u00e9par\u00e9 dina tanggal 12 M\u00e9i 2015."}
{"id": "106103", "revid": "27597", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106103", "title": "Ibrahim Musa", "text": "Syekh Ibrahim Musa anu kawentar ku gelar Inyiak Parab\u00e9k (4 Agustus 1884 \u2013 25 Juli 1963) nya\u00e9ta saurang ulama, politikus, jeung pangajar ti Indon\u00e9sia. Sanggeus ngaliwatan sababaraha paguron, dina umur 18 taun anjeuna indit ka Mekah pikeun diajar salila 8 taun. Anjeuna mulang deui ka Minangkabau dina taun 1909 sarta mimiti ngajar dina taun 1912. Satuluyna, anjeunna indit deui ka Mekah dina taun anyar jeung mulang deui dina taun 1915. Waktu \u00e9ta, anjeunna geus meunang gelar Syekh Ibrahim Musa atawa Inyiak Parabek minangka pangakuan kana \u00e9lmu agamana.\nNalika mulang deui ka Minangkabau, Inyiak Parabek ngadegkeun Sumatra Thawalib di Parab\u00e9k, sedengkeun Inyiak Abdul Karim Amrullah (kolotna Buya Hamka) ngadegkeun Thawalib di Padang Panjang. Madrasah anu diadegkeun dina taun 1910 dimimitian ku halaqah di Parab\u00e9k. Lilana pendidikanana variatif, aya anu nepi ka 11 taun. Tapi saprak taun 1980 nepi ka ayeuna, waktu pendidikanana jadi 6 taun. Bedana, ayeuna aya pendidikan Takhashus, anu ngamungkinkeun murid-murid Parab\u00e9k anu geus tamat tapi teu acan wareg ku \u00e9lmu-na pikeun nambahan pendidikan nonformal.\nKahirupan.\nSapanjang hirupna, Ibrahim Musa kungsi kawin sababaraha kali, tapi teu sakab\u00e9hna miboga anak. Tina kawin jeung Syarifah Gani, putri H. Abdul Gani, saurang sudagar beunghar ti Padang, anjeunna boga tilu urang anak: Maryam Ibrahim, Thahir Ibrahim, sareng Thaiyyib Ibrahim. Syarifah Gani ngadampingan anjeunna nepi ka wafat.\nSatuluyna, anjeunna kawin jeung Rimbok asal Karatau jeung Limbok asal Lima Puluh Kota. Ti Rimbok, anjeunna boga lima urang anak: Shafiah Ibrahim, Sa\u2019adah Ibrahim, Anis Ibrahim, Halimah Sa\u2019diyah, sareng Muhammad Farid Ibrahim (dua anak anu pamungkas pupus waktu masih k\u00e9n\u00e9h leutik). Sedengkeun tina kawin sareng Limbok, anjeunna dikaruniai saurang putri, nya\u00e9ta Khadijah Ibrahim.\nPamajikan anjeunna anu s\u00e9j\u00e9n nya\u00e9ta: Daraham asal Taluak, Jibat asal Parabek Ateh, Fatimah asal Sariak, jeung Hikam asal Kapeh Panji. Sa\u2019adah Ibrahim nikah sareng Abdul Muis St Batungkek Ameh. Di antara anak maran\u00e9hna nya\u00e9ta dr. Asril Moeis, SpOG sareng Ibu Ir. Susi Zahrawati Moeis, M.T.\nKarya.\nIeu sababaraha karya Syekh Ibrahim Musa:"}
{"id": "106104", "revid": "27597", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106104", "title": "Sulaiman Ar-Rasuli", "text": "Sulaiman Ar-Rasuli anu og\u00e9 dipikawanoh salaku Inyiak Canduang (10 Desember 1871 \u2013 1 Agustus 1970) nya\u00e9ta saurang ulama Minangkabau anu ngadegkeun Persatuan Tarbiyah Islamiyah (Perti) jeung Madrasah Tarbiyah Islamiyah (MTI) Canduang. Anjeunna dianggap salaku tokoh anu nyebarkeun gagasan keterpaduan adat Minangkabau jeung syariat ngaliwatan ungkapan \"Adaik basandi syarak, syarak basandi Kitabullah\".\nKahirupan.\nPangatikan.\nSulaiman lahir di Candung tanggal 10 D\u00e9s\u00e9mber 1871 tina pasangan Muhammad Rasul Tuanku Mudo jeung Siti Buliah. Anjeuna meunang pendidikan agama anu kahiji ti bapana anu mangrupakeun guru agama di Surau Tangah. Aki Sulaiman ti pihak bapana, Tuanku Nan Paik, og\u00e9 mangrupakeun ulama di Candung.\nDina taun 1881, anjeuna diajar al-Qur'an ka Sy\u00e9kh Abdurrahman jeung Sy\u00e9kh Muhammad Arsyad di Batuhampar. Dua taun saterusna, anjeuna ngarantau ka Biaro pikeun diajar basa Arab ka Syekh Abdussamad Tuanku Samiak. Waktu Tuanku Samiak teu ngajar sabab indit haji, Sulaiman ngajarkeun ka Sy\u00e9kh Muhammad Ali Tuanku Kolok, Sy\u00e9kh Muhammad Salim Sungai Dareh, jeung Sy\u00e9kh Abdussalam Banuhampu. Dina taun 1890, anjeuna diajar fikih, usul fikih, tafsir al-Qur'an, tauhid, jeung sajabana ka Sy\u00e9kh Abdullah di Halaban, tuluy ngajar di surau guruna ti taun 1896.\nDina taun 1902, Sulaiman balik ka Canduang pikeun ngajar di ditu nepi ka angkat haji dina taun 1903. Di Mekah, man\u00e9hna diajar ka sababaraha ulama di ditu salila opat taun. Sababaraha ulama anu jadi guru Sulaiman di antarana Sy\u00e9kh Ahmad Khatib al-Minankabawi, Sy\u00e9kh Mukhtar Atarid al-Bughuri, Sy\u00e9kh Umar Bajunaid al-Hadrami, Sy\u00e9kh Ahmad Syata al-Makki, Sy\u00e9kh Ali al-Kalantani, Sy\u00e9kh Usman as-Sarawaqi, Sy\u00e9kh Said al-Yamani, jeung Sy\u00e9kh Ahmad al-Fatani.\nSaenggeus nyorang ilmu di Mekah, Sy\u00e9kh Sulaiman balik deui ka Minangkabau tuluy muka halaqah di Surau Baru, Candung dina taun 1908. Dina taun 1923, anejuna balik deui ka Batuhampar pikeun bersuluk di handapeun bimbingan Sy\u00e9kh Muhammad Arsyad. Ti Sy\u00e9kh Arsyad, Sy\u00e9kh Sulaiman meunang ijazah mursyid Naqsyabandiyah."}
{"id": "106105", "revid": "31482", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106105", "title": "\u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a", "text": "\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9d\u1b94 \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b9d\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b8d\u1b98\u1b8d\u1ba4 \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b83\u1b96\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b8a \u1b92\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b93\u1b9b\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b96\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b8a-\u1b9a\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b9e\u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b92\u1ba5 \u1b9c\u1ba8\u1b8c\u1b94. \u1b9d\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b94 \u1b92\u1ba9 \u1b95\u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b86\u1ba6\u1b8e\u1b9e\u1baa, \u1b8a\u1ba7\u1b99\u1ba7 \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b9c\u1ba8\u1b98\u1b82 \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b99\u1b82: \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b83\u1b96\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b8a \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b95\u1ba5\u1b80 \u1b93\u1ba9\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b92\u1baa \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9b\u1ba5\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1ba6\u1b9d\u1b90\u1baa, \u1b9e\u1ba8\u1b93\u1ba4\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b83\u1b9a \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b9e\u1b95\u1b94\u1baa\u1b8f\u1b80 \u1b93\u1b81\u1b94\u1ba6\u1b9c, \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b92\u1baa \u1b99\u1b81\u1b99\u1b9b, \u1b98\u1ba7\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b95\u1ba7\u1b9b\u1ba5\u1b9e\u1baa, \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b92\u1baa \u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b93\u1ba9\u1b80, \u1b95\u1b8d\u1ba5\u1b94\u1ba5\u1b8d\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1b85\u1b8a\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9e\u1baa, \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b8a\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b9a, \u1b9d\u1b9c\u1ba5\u1b8d\u1b94\u1baa \u1b85\u1b9b\u1b9c\u1baa. \u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b9b |\u1bb6\u1bb0|% \u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b95\u1ba7\u1b95\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1b9e\u1ba4 \u1b9e\u1b93\u1ba5\u1b91 \u1b83\u1b9a \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a. \u1ba6\u1b92\u1b99\u1baa\u1b95\u1ba7 \u1b87\u1ba6\u1b8c \u1b9a\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a.\n\u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba7\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8d\u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9d\u1b94 \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b9e\u1b98\u1b98\u1b9b\u1ba0 \u1b95\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1ba7 \u1b9e\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b93\u1ba9\u1b9b\u1ba9\u1b94\u1b94 \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b9e\u1b99\u1ba5\u1b93\u1ba8\u1b9b \u1b84\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1ba7\u1ba6\u1b94\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b98 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b95\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b96\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa.\n\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b98\u1baa\u1b9d\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1b9a\u1b82.\n\u1b9e\u1b8a\u1ba5\u1b99\u1ba0 \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b8c\u1ba9\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b9e\u1ba8\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b92\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1ba6\u1b9a\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b98\u1ba4\u1b9e \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b83\u1b80\u1b8c\u1b95\u1baa \u1b9e\u1b9c\u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b98\u1baa\u1b9d\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1b9a\u1b82 \u1b9a\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b9c\u1ba9\u1b9d\u1ba4\u1b82 \u1b8c\u1ba8\u1ba6\u1b93. \u1b95\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b98\u1b98\u1b8c\u1ba4\u1b9a\u1b94\u1baa \u1b94\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1ba5\u1b92\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b84\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9c\u1b82 \u1b84\u1b89, \u1ba6\u1b92\u1b99\u1baa\u1b95\u1ba7 \u1b9a\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8a\u1b9c\u1ba6\u1b81 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b9a\u1ba5\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b92\u1ba8\u1b8d\u1b82.\n\u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b99\u1ba4\u1b94\u1baa\u1b93\u1ba8\u1b80 \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b98\u1b8c\u1ba4 \u1b8f\u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b9e\u1b98\u1b98\u1b9b\u1ba0 \u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b98\u1baa\u1b9d\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1b9a\u1b82:"}
{"id": "106106", "revid": "31482", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106106", "title": "\u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95", "text": "\u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b91\u1b86\u1b92 \u1b9e\u1b9c\u1b9e\u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b8f\u1ba4 \u1b92\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b92\u1ba5\u1b8f\u1ba5\u1baa \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9d\u1b94 \u1b92\u1ba2\u1b93\u1ba4\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a\u1ba7\u1b94\u1b9c\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b99\u1b81\u1b8e\u1b95\u1b93. \u1b9e\u1b8e\u1b9b \u1b96\u1ba4\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1ba6\u1b8c\u1b9a\u1ba7\u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b8c\u1ba4\u1b9e\u1baa, \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b99\u1b80\u1b9b\u1ba5\u1b95 \u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b99\u1ba4\u1b94\u1b94\u1baa\u1b8f\u1ba5\u1b80 \u1b95\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b94\u1baa\u1b94 \u1b92\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b86\u1b9b\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a, \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1ba7\u1b94\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a. \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b93\u1ba4\u1b9d\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9e\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b9e\u1b99\u1ba5\u1b93\u1ba2 \u1b83\u1b81\u1b8a\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b98\u1ba8\u1b9c\u1b82 \u1b8a\u1ba6\u1b9c\u1b9b\u1ba9\u1b94, \u1b9e\u1b99\u1ba5\u1b93\u1ba2 \u1b83\u1b92\u1baa\u1b9c\u1b94\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1ba7\u1ba6\u1b94\u1ba9\u1b94, \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b92\u1baa \u1ba6\u1b99\u1b93\u1ba4\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9b\u1b94\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b93\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1ba9\u1b94, \u1b9e\u1b81\u1b92 \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1ba6\u1b9d\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b93\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1baa\u1b94 \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b8f\u1b9c\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8e\u1b84 \u1b94\u1ba5 \u1b8d\u1ba0\u1ba5\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1ba6\u1b99\u1b93\u1ba4\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b9b\u1b94\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8a\u1b94 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b8a\u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b95\u1baa \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b92\u1baa \u1ba0\u1ba4\u1b93\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b95\u1b8c\u1ba5\u1b94\u1ba5\u1b8d\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8a\u1b85\u1b8a\u1b9e\u1ba5\u1b9e\u1baa. \u1b93\u1ba4 \u1b98\u1ba8\u1ba0\u1b82 \u1ba6\u1b9d\u1b92\u1b94\u1baa\u1b94, \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1b8a\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b9e\u1b82\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8a\u1ba5 \u1b98\u1b98\u1b8c\u1b94\u1baa \u1b8e\u1b84 \u1b95\u1b8c\u1ba5\u1b94\u1ba5\u1b8d\u1b94\u1baa \u1b85\u1b9b\u1b9c\u1baa \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b9c\u1b85\u1b92\u1baa \u1b8a\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b95\u1ba4\u1b9a.\n\u1b94\u1ba5\u1b99\u1ba5\u1b92\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b9c\u1ba8\u1b8c\u1b94, \u1b86\u1b9b\u1ba7\u1b95 \u1ba6\u1b92\u1b82 \u1b99\u1ba4\u1b94\u1b80\u1b8a \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9d\u1b94 \u1b95\u1b80\u1b9c\u1ba9\u1b92\u1ba4\u1b8a\u1baa\u1b94 \u1b8a\u1b93\u1ba5\u1b9d \u1b9e\u1b80\u1b8c\u1ba9\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b83\u1b85\u1b9e\u1baa\u1b92\u1ba2\u1b9c\u1ba4\u1b9a, \u1b8d\u1b9d\u1ba8\u1b80\u1b8a\u1ba5 |\u1bb1\u1bb0\u1bb4\u1bb0\u1bb0\u1bb0\u1bb0\u1bb0| \u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1ba7\u1ba6\u1b99\u1b92\u1ba8\u1b81 \u1b95\u1b9e\u1b8c\u1ba4 \u1b83\u1b92\u1b9d |\u1bb2,\u1bb0|% \u1b92\u1ba4\u1b94 \u1b83\u1b99\u1baa\u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1baa \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b99\u1ba4. \u1b94\u1ba5\u1b99\u1ba5\u1b92\u1baa\u1b8a\u1ba9\u1b94\u1baa \u1b95\u1ba7\u1b95\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b94, \u1b84\u1b89 \u1b98\u1ba5\u1b9d\u1b94 \u1ba6\u1b92\u1b82 \u1b8a\u1b92\u1ba4\u1b9c\u1ba5 \u1b95\u1b80\u1b98\u1b93\u1b8c\u1baa\u1b94 (\u1b9e\u1b80\u1b8c\u1ba9\u1b9e\u1baa \u1b83\u1b9e\u1ba4\u1b9a \u1b8f\u1ba9\u1b80 \u1b83\u1b96\u1ba2\u1ba4\u1b8a) \u1b8a\u1b9c\u1b9d\u1b94\u1baa \u1b95\u1ba7\u1b95\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1b9e\u1ba4 |\u1bb7\u1bb1\u1bb0| \u1b8f\u1ba5\u1b92 \u1b83\u1b92\u1b9d \u1b8a\u1ba4\u1b9b |\u1bb1\u1bb1|% \u1b92\u1ba4 \u1b95\u1ba7\u1b9c\u1ba5\u1b9c\u1b9e\u1ba4 \u1b9e\u1b93\u1ba5\u1b91."}
{"id": "106107", "revid": "27597", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106107", "title": "Bisri Mustofa", "text": "K.H. Bisri Mustofa mangrupAkeun hiji tokoh Nahdlatul Ulama, salah sahiji ulama Nusantara anu lahir di Kampung Sawahan Gang Palen, Rembang, Jawa Tengah dina taun 1915. Bapana nya\u00e9ta hiji padagang beunghar anu ngaranna Haji Zainal Mustofa (Djojo Mustopo) bin H. Yahya (Podjojo), anu dipikawanoh rajin dina ngalaksanakeun agama sarta kacida nyaahna ka para Kiai. Indungna ngaranna Hajjah Chodijah binti E. Zajjadi bin E. Sjamsuddin anu asalna ti Makassar.\nKiai Bisri Mustofa wafat dina umur 63 taun, dina tanggal 16 P\u00e9bruari 1977. Waktu harita, masarakat Indon\u00e9sia keur nyanghareupan Pemilu 1977 dina jaman Orde Anyar. Anjeunna og\u00e9 mangrupakeun Anggota Konstituante RI anu ngawakilan Nahdlatul Ulama."}
{"id": "106108", "revid": "27597", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106108", "title": "Zainab binti Jahsy", "text": "Zainab binti Jahsy bin Ri`ab al-Asadiyyah (\u0628\u06d5 \u0633\u0648\u0646\u062f\u0627: \u0632\u064a\u0646\u0628 \u0628\u0646\u062a \u062c\u062d\u0634 \u0628\u0646 \u0631\u0626\u0627\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u062f\u064a\u0629), anu leuwih dipikawanoh minangka Zainab binti Jahsy, lahir dina taun 33 Saacan Hijriyah (590 M) jeung wafat di Madinah dina taun 20 H (641 M). Anjeunna mangrupakeun alo sarta istri ti Nabi Muhammad, jeung kaasup salah sahiji ti kalangan Ibu Para Mukminin.\nNasab.\nBapana: Jahsy bin Ri`ab bin Yu'ammar bin Shabrah bin Kabir bin Ghanam bin Dudan bin Asad bin Khuzaimah bin Mudrikah bin Ilyas bin Mudhar bin Nizar bin Ma'ad bin Adnan. Jahsy mangrupa sekutu pikeun hiji pangged\u00e9 Quraisy, nya\u00e9ta Abdul Muthalib.\nIndungna: Umaimah binti Abdul Muthalib bin Hasyim bin Abdu Manaf bin Qushay bin Kilab bin Murrah bin Ka'ab bin Lu`ay bin Ghalib bin Fihr bin Malik bin an-Nadhar bin Kinanah bin Khuzaimah bin Mudrikah bin Ilyas bin Mudhar bin Nizar bin Ma'ad bin Adnan. Umaimah mangrupikeun bibi ti Nabi Muhammad.\nKahirupan.\nZainab binti Jahsy nya\u00e9ta alo Nabi Muhammad jeung dina awalna, istri ti anak angkat Nabi, Zaid bin Haritsah. Numutkeun Aisyah, salah sahiji istri Nabi anu dianggap paling disayang, Zainab ngagaduhan kageulisan anu disandingkeun jeung kageulisanna.\nZainab binti Jahsy mangrupakeun aw\u00e9w\u00e9 mulya ti golongan bangsawan sarta sepupu Rasulullah anu terpilih janten salah sahiji pasangan jiwa Nabi. Tapi, balik pros\u00e9s pernikahan \u00e9ta, aya carita anu dramatis, lantaran ngalibetkeun anak angkat Rasulullah, nya\u00e9ta Zaid bin Haritsah, anu san\u00e9s lain mangrupikeun mantan salaki Zainab binti Jahsy.\nKu kituna, naha status pernikahan Rasulullah anu nikah jeung mantan istri ti anak angkatna sorangan tiasa dibenerkeun? Naha hal ieu san\u00e9s malah memicu kontroversi pikeun kaum munafik sareng para pembenci, sahingga nambahkeun kebencian tibatan pencerahan? Hayu urang bahas ieu kalayan j\u00e9ntr\u00e9.\nPerkawinan.\nCarita ieu dimimitian ku lamaran Rasulullah Muhammad ka Zainab pikeun Zaid bin Haritsah, budak anu dipikanyaah ku Nabi, anu geus dibebaskeun sarta dianggap salaku anak ti saprak leutik. Salaku bapa angkat anu hade, Nabi Muhammad tangtu hoyong anu pangalusna pikeun Zaid, sanajan status Zaid ngan mantan budak. Nalika Nabi sumping ka imah Zainab pikeun ngalamar, aya hiji b\u00e9dana pandangan anu kacida kentelna antara maran\u00e9hna. Nu teu diduga, Zainab kungsi nolak lamaran \u00e9ta.\nAlesanna Zainab nya\u00e9ta aw\u00e9w\u00e9 mulya anu asalna ti golongan bangsawan Quraisy. Status sosialna anu luhur nyababkeun anjeunna ragu narima Zaid, anu asalna ti golongan budak. Hal ieu ngagambarkeun pandangan umum di masarakat Jahiliah waktu harita, anu ngab\u00e9dakeun kelas sosial jeung martabat jalma. Sanajan Zainab nolak, Rasulullah ngajelaskeun y\u00e9n ieu lamaran san\u00e9s ngan ukur perkara pribadi, tapi mangrupakeun bagian tina wangsit pikeun ngalakukeun hiji pembaharuan dina Islam. Rasulullah hoyong ngajarkeun y\u00e9n martabat jalma henteu ditangtukeun ku asal-usul atawa status sosialna, tapi ku takwa jeung amal shaleh. Ahirna, Zainab narima lamaran \u00e9ta ku dasar taat kana kahayang Allah jeung Rasul-Nya, ngaleungitkeun ego sosialna. Ieu janten conto pikeun umat Islam dina ngaleungitkeun diskriminasi sosial.\nPerkawinan antara Zainab jeung Zaid ngagambarkeun ajaran Islam anu egaliter, dimana unggal jalma boga kasempetan anu sarua dina kahirupan. Sanajan ahirna pernikahan ieu teu lumangsung lila lantaran b\u00e9da pandangan antara Zainab jeung Zaid, kajadian ieu ngawangun dasar pikeun pembaharuan hukum dina Islam."}
{"id": "106109", "revid": "32463", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106109", "title": "Aminah binti Wahb", "text": "Aminah binti Wahb ( basa Arab : \u0622\u0645\u0646\u0629 \u0628\u0646\u062a \u0648\u0647\u0628 ; \"\u02be\u0100minah binti Wahb\" ', wafat 577 M) nya\u00e9ta indung Nabi Muhammad SAW.\nKalahiran &amp; Kahirupan Kulawarga.\nAmina lahir di Mekah. Bapana Aminah nya\u00e9ta pamingpin Bani Zuhrah , anu ngaranna Wahb bin Abdi Manaf bin Zuhrah bin Kilab bin Murrah bin Ka'ab bin Lu'ay bin Ghalib bin Fihr. \u00a0Sedengkeun indung Aminah nya\u00e9ta Labirah binti Abdil 'Uzza bin Utsman bin Abd ad-Dar bin Qushay bin Kilab bin Murrah bin Ka'ab bin Lu'ay bin Ghalib bin Fihr.\nDilahirkeun dina pertengahan abad ka-6 Masehi ti kulawarga anu dianggap suku anu paling terhormat sarta boga silsilah anu mulya, nepi ka Nabi saw. sakali ngomong:\n\"\"Gusti terus mindahkeun kuring tina iga alus ka rahim suci, dipilih, tur dididik. Teu aya jalan anu forcks dua, iwal kuring dina jalan pangalusna\".\"\nRupa-rupa sumber nyebutkeun y\u00e9n Aminah \u00e9ta aw\u00e9w\u00e9 Quraisy pangalusna, mimitian ti nasab jeung kalungguhan. Anjeunna ibu anu salawasna diberkahan sarta salawasna dikurilingan ku warta alus sabab ngaranna bakal langgeng.\nPerkawinan.\nAminah binti Wahb nikah ka dulurna Abdullah bin Abdul Mutthallib. Dina waktos \u00e9ta, Aminah mangrupikeun aw\u00e9w\u00e9 anu paling mulya di kalangan Quraisy boh tina segi nasab sareng jabatan di masarakat. Tina kamulyaan \u00e9ta, Aminah dianggap mampuh ngumpulkeun atawa ngahijikeun dua kamulyaan ti turunan Abdi Manaf anu baris diturunkeun ka anakna engk\u00e9, nya\u00e9ta ti turunan Abdi Manaf bin Zuhrah bin Kilab, jeung Abdi Manaf bin Qushai bin Kilab. \u00a0Ieu ngabuktikeun y\u00e9n Nabi Muhammad t\u00e9h jalma mulya anu turunan jalma mulya anu geus dipilih ku Allah. Sakumaha dawuhan Nabi SAW dina hadits shahih:\u201cSa\u00e9stuna Alloh SWT geus milih Kianah ti turunan Ismail, jeung milih Quraisy ti Kinanah, jeung milih Bani Hasyim ti Quraisy, jeung milih kuring ti Bani Hasyim\u201d.Aminah kenal ka Abdullah ti leuleutik sabab kulawarga Bani Hasyim mangrupa kulawarga anu pangdeukeutna jeung Bani Zuhrah. Tina lobana lalaki anu datang ngalamar Aminah, salah sahijina nya\u00e9ta Abdullah bin Abdul Mutthallib. Waktu harita teu aya deui jalmi anu langkung mulya ti batan Abdullah boh dina hal katurunan boh kaluhuran kapamingpinan di masarakat."}
{"id": "106112", "revid": "21463", "url": "https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106112", "title": "Muamalah", "text": "Fikih muamalah nya\u00e9ta salah sahiji cabang ilmu fikih dina Islam anu ngatur sagala asp\u00e9k interaksi jeung hubungan sosial-\u00e9konomi jeung jalma s\u00e9j\u00e9n. Sacara harfiah, \u201cmuamalah\u201d miboga harti transaksi atawa interaksi, jeung dina kont\u00e9ks ieu, ngawengku sagala rupa transaksi \u00e9konomi, perjanjian, jual meuli, jeung kontrak anu dilakukeun ku umat Islam. Fikih Muamalah penting pisan dina mastikeun y\u00e9n kagiatan \u00e9konomi jeung sosial anu dilakukeun ku umat Islam luyu jeung hukum syariah. Tujuan utama fikih muamalah nya\u00e9ta pikeun mastikeun unggal transaksi luyu jeung prinsip kaadilan sarta teu ngandung unsur riba, \"gharar\" (kahenteupastian), atawa \"maysir\" (judi).\nPrinsip dasar.\nPrinsip utama dina fikih muamalah nya\u00e9ta kaadilan (\"'adl\"), kajujuran (\"\u1e63idq\"), jeung silih ridha (\"tar\u0101\u1e0din\"). Al-Qur'an jeung Hadis jadi sumber utama dina fikih ieu, saperti anu ditegeskeun dina Al-Qur'an Surah Al-Baqarah ayat 282, anu nuduhkeun pentingna nyatet hutang-piutang pikeun nyingkahan konflik. Salian ti \u00e9ta, prinsip larangan riba diterangkeun dina Surah Al-Baqarah ayat 275\u2013279, anu nyebut y\u00e9n riba t\u00e9h ngaliwat ka \u00e9tiq Islam sabab miboga sipat nganyenyeri.\nRuang lingkup.\nRuang lingkup fikih muamalah ngawengku rupa-rupa jinis transaksi saperti:\nJual beuli (\"bai\"').\nTransaksi anu ngalibetkeun silih tuker barang atawa jasa kalayan imbalan nu tangtu. Dina Islam, jual beuli kudu b\u00e9bas tina unsur tipu daya atawa \"gharar\".\nNy\u00e9wa-m\u00e9ny\u00e9wa (\"ijarah)\".\nPasatujuan pikeun ngamangpaatkeun jasa atawa barang dina jangka waktu anu disatujuan.\nGaw\u00e9 bareng usaha (\"syirkah)\".\nNgawengku dua pihak atawa leuwih anu ngahiji modal pikeun tujuan usaha babarengan, saperti \"mudharabah\" (bagi hasil).\nNginjeum-nginjeum (\"qardh\").\nNginjeuman anu dib\u00e9r\u00e9 tanpa syarat tambahan atawa kauntungan pikeun anu maparin hutang."}
